    "description": "A look at the Hutterites, an Anabaptist religious community similar to the Amish or the Mennonites in rural Alberta.  The followers of religious leader Jacob Hutter live in farm communities, devoutly holding to the rules their founder laid down four centuries ago. Through the kindness of a Hutterite colony in Alberta, this film, in black and white, was made inside the community and shows all aspects of the Hutterites' daily life.",
